<title>UK: Mexico sets 1.5 billion mark 12-year bond.</title>
<headline>Mexico sets 1.5 billion mark 12-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MEXICO</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     8.25 PCT  MATURITY    24.FEB.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.665   PAY DATE    24.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  3.0 PCT   REOFFER    99.665    SPREAD	+260 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BA2	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.0 PCT   SELL CONC  1.5 PCT   LISTING     0.50 PCT</p>
